    "name": "Shield of the Void",
    "abilities": [
        {
            "id": "000010726",
            "name": "Focused Response",
            "description": "<ul><li>Each time an <span class=\"kwb\">ADEPTUS</span> <span class=\"kwb\">ASTARTES</span> model from your army makes an attack while firing Overwatch, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ is required to score a hit, instead of an unmodified 6.</li><li>Each time an enemy unit makes an attack that targets an <span class=\"kwb\">ADEPTUS</span> <span class=\"kwb\">ASTARTES</span> unit from your army that is Set To Defend, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.</li></ul>",
            "legend": "The battle-brothers of the Shield Chapters commit their boarding strikes with a measured and meticulous application of force. They storm one section after the next while maintaining heightened awareness of lurking threats, and readying themselves to launch devastating counterattacks.",
