            "phase": "Shooting phase",
            "description": "<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class=\"kwb\">ADEPTUS</span> <span class=\"kwb\">ASTARTES</span> unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one of the following abilities: [LETHAL HITS], [IGNORES COVER] or [SUSTAINED HITS 1]. Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have that ability.",
